# AniStrim Architecture — How It Works (100% Explained)

This document explains, end-to-end and in plain terms, how the current
AniStrim backend + three clients are _supposed_ to work after all fixes.
An AI or human reading this should understand every request path, every
decision point, and every data flow without needing to cross-reference
other files.

