All three clients talk to **the same `/api/*` endpoints** on a single
Express server. They differ only in:

- The static root the server serves them from
- The `X-Client` header they set on API calls
- Their localStorage token key prefixes

Admin dashboard is served from `/admin/*` and is its own client too.

